build a payment saas called "monetamesh" to handles monetary payments from merchants

Api surface for monetamesh

Auth / merchant onboarding

POST /v1/auth/signup — register a merchant + owner account
POST /v1/auth/verify-email — confirm signup
POST /v1/auth/login — issue access + refresh tokens
POST /v1/auth/refresh — rotate access token
POST /v1/auth/logout — revoke refresh token
Merchant profile

GET /v1/merchants/me — view own profile/config
PATCH /v1/merchants/me — update business/KYC fields
PATCH /v1/merchants/me/config — enabled currencies, payment methods, etc.
API keys (for merchant's server-to-server integration)

POST /v1/api-keys — create a key pair (secret shown once)
GET /v1/api-keys — list keys (no secrets)
POST /v1/api-keys/{id}/regenerate
DELETE /v1/api-keys/{id} — revoke
Payments (core)

POST /v1/payments — create a payment/charge
GET /v1/payments/{id} — fetch status
GET /v1/payments — list/filter merchant's payments
POST /v1/payments/{id}/refund — full/partial refund
Webhooks (notify merchants of events)

POST /v1/webhooks — register a merchant callback URL
GET /v1/webhooks / DELETE /v1/webhooks/{id}
Health

GET /healthz, GET /readyz